.com/assets_brightluxx-logo-nav.png\" alt=\"Brightluxx\"/></a><nav class=\"site-nav\" aria-label=\"Primary navigation\" data-testid=\"desktop-navigation-menu\"><button type=\"button\" data-testid=\"nav-products\">PRODUCTS <span>⌄</span></button><button type=\"button\" data-testid=\"nav-solutions\">SOLUTIONS <span>⌄</span></button><a data-testid=\"nav-lumimorph\" href=\"/lumimorph\">LUMIMORPH</a><a data-testid=\"nav-naturatex\" href=\"/naturatex\">NATURATEX</a><a data-testid=\"nav-signatouch\" href=\"/signatouch\">SIGNATOUCH</a><a data-testid=\"nav-glassmorph\" href=\"/glassmorph\">GLASSMORPH</a><button type=\"button\" data-testid=\"nav-more-btn\">☰ <span>⌄</span></button></nav><button class=\"mobile-menu-button\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Toggle navigation\" data-testid=\"mobile-menu-toggle\">☰</button></div></header><main class=\"legacy-page\" data-testid=\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Transparent \\u0026 Glass\",\"description\":\"Transparent LED solutions for glass facades.\",\"url\":\"https://brightluxx.com/solutions/transparent\",\"provider\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Brightluxx\",\"url\":\"https://brightluxx.com\",\"logo\":\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"},\"areaServed\":[\"United Arab Emirates\",\"Saudi Arabia\",\"Qatar\",\"Kuwait\",\"Bahrain\",\"Oman\"]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How does transparent LED work?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"LED strips are mounted on a see-through lattice or film, so content displays while 60–90% of light passes through — keeping glass facades and windows visually open.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Where is transparent LED used best?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Glass facades, car showrooms, mall storefronts and atriums — anywhere you want digital content by night without losing daylight or visibility by day.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can transparent LED be retrofitted to existing glass?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes — adhesive LED film retrofits directly onto existing glazing, while lattice panels mount just behind the glass with minimal structural work.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://brightluxx.com\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Solutions\",\"item\":\"https://brightluxx.com/solutions\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Solutions — Transparent\",\"item\":\"https://brightluxx.com/solutions/transparent\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\",\"name\":\"Brightluxx\",\"legalName\":\"Brightluxx LED Displays\",\"url\":\"https://brightluxx.com\",\"logo\":\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\",\"telephone\":\"+971559954274\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\",\"addressLocality\":\"Dubai\",\"addressCountry\":\"AE\"},\"contactPoint\":{\"@type\":\"ContactPoint\",\"telephone\":\"+971559954274\",\"contactType\":\"sales\",\"areaServed\":[\"AE\",\"SA\",\"QA\",\"KW\",\"BH\",\"OM\"],\"availableLanguage\":[\"en\",\"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"LocalBusiness\",\"@id\":\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\",\"name\":\"Brightluxx LED Displays\",\"image\":\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\",\"url\":\"https://brightluxx.com\",\"telephone\":\"+971559954274\",\"priceRange\":\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m²\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\",\"addressLocality\":\"Dubai\",\"addressCountry\":\"AE\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":24.9857,\"longitude\":55.0272},\"openingHoursSpecification\":{\"@type\":\"OpeningHoursSpecification\",\"dayOfWeek\":[\"Monday\",\"Tuesday\",\"Wednesday\",\"Thursday\",\"Friday\",\"Saturday\"],\"opens\":\"09:00\",\"closes\":\"18:00\"},\"areaServed\":[\"Dubai\",\"Abu Dhabi\",\"United Arab Emirates\",\"Saudi Arabia\",\"Qatar\",\"Kuwait\",\"Bahrain\",\"Oman\"]}</script><article class=\"legacy-page__content\" data-testid=\"legacy-page-content\"><h1>Solutions — Transparent</h1><p>Solutions — Transparent. Premium LED display solutions by Brightluxx in Dubai, UAE.</p><h2>Transparent &amp; Glass LED — FAQs</h2><h3>How does transparent LED work?</h3><p>LED strips are mounted on a see-through lattice or film, so content displays while 60–90% of light passes through — keeping glass facades and windows visually open.</p><h3>Where is transparent LED used best?</h3><p>Glass facades, car showrooms, mall storefronts and atriums — anywhere you want digital content by night without losing daylight or visibility by day.</p><h3>Can transparent LED be retrofitted to existing glass?</h3><p>Yes — adhesive LED film retrofits directly onto existing glazing, while lattice panels mount just behind the glass with minimal structural work.</p></article><section class=\"seo-content-block\" data-testid=\"seo-content-block\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Specification guidance</p><h2>Solutions — Transparent<!-- --> — project planning</h2><div class=\"seo-content-block__copy\"><p>Solutions — Transparent. Premium LED display solutions by Brightluxx in Dubai, UAE.<!-- --> Brightluxx helps teams translate viewing distance, ambient light, operating hours and site constraints into an LED display specification that can be installed, maintained and expanded with confidence.</p><p>Start with the audience and environment, then confirm pixel pitch, brightness, processing, power access and serviceability. Our engineering team can review drawings, recommend a suitable display family and coordinate the practical requirements for delivery and commissioning.</p></div><nav class=\"seo-content-block__links\" aria-label=\"Related Brightluxx resources\"><a data-testid=\"seo-internal-link-products\" href=\"/products\">Explore LED displays<span>→</span></a><a data-testid=\"seo-internal-link-solutions\" href=\"/solutions\">Plan a solution<span>→</span></a><a data-testid=\"seo-internal-link-resources\" href=\"/resources\">Technical resources<span>→</span></a><a data-testid=\"seo-internal-link-contact\" href=\"/contact\">Talk to an engineer<span>→</span></a></nav></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class=\"site-footer\" data-testid=\"footer\"><div class=\"site-footer__inner\"><section class=\"site-footer__brand\"><a href=\"/\"><img src=\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/assets_brightluxx-logo-nav.png\" alt=\"Brightluxx\"/></a><p>Premium LED display solutions for UAE and MENA. Established since 2005.</p><div><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/brightluxx/\" aria-label=\"Instagram\" data-testid=\"footer-social-instagram\">◎</a><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/brightluxx/\" aria-label=\"LinkedIn\" data-testid=\"footer-social-linkedin\">in</a></div></section><section><h2>EXPLORE</h2><a href=\"/products\">PRODUCTS</a><a href=\"/solutions\">SOLUTIONS</a><a href=\"/technology\">TECHNOLOGY</a><a href=\"/case-studies\">CASE STUDIES</a><a href=\"/blog\">BLOG</a></section><section><h2>LOCATIONS</h2><a href=\"/dubai\">DUBAI</a><a href=\"/abu-dhabi\">ABU DHABI</a><a href=\"/saudi-arabia\">SAUDI ARABIA</a><a href=\"/qatar\">QATAR</a><a href=\"/kuwait\">KUWAIT</a><a href=\"/bahrain\">BAHRAIN</a><a href=\"/oman\">OMAN</a></section><section><h2>COMPANY</h2><a href=\"/about\">ABOUT US</a><a href=\"/contact\">CONTACT US</a><a href=\"/factory-tour\">FACTORY TOUR</a><a href=\"/faq\">FAQ</a><a href=\"/resources\">RESOURCES</a></section><section><h2>CONTACT</h2><a href=\"https://maps.google.com/?q=Jebel+Ali+Industrial+Area+1+Dubai\" data-testid=\"footer-map-link\">Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1, Dubai, UAE</a><a href=\"tel:+97142585754\" data-testid=\"footer-phone-link\">+971 4 258 5754</a><a href=\"mailto:sales@brightluxx.com\" data-testid=\"footer-email-link\">sales@brightluxx.com</a></section></div><div class=\"site-footer__bottom\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> BRIGHTLUXX. ALL RIGHTS RESERVED.<span>A DIVISION OF IHG INDUSTRY L.L.C</span></div></footer><a class=\"floating-whatsapp\" href=\"https://wa.me/971559954274\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" data-testid=\"global-whatsapp-link\" aria-label=\"WhatsApp\">◔</a><a class=\"floating-phone\" href=\"tel:+97142585754\" data-testid=\"global-phone-link\" aria-label=\"Call Brightluxx\">☎</a><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:\\\"$Sreact.suspense\\\"\\n3:I[31262,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2stsi6mfnjcsf.js\\\"],\\\"PageViewTracker\\\"]\\n4:I[48303,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2stsi6mfnjcsf.js\\\"],\\\"SiteHeader\\\"]\\n5:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2stsi6mfnjcsf.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n6:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2stsi6mfnjcsf.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n7:I[22016,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2stsi6mfnjcsf.js\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\n8:I[52006,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2stsi6mfnjcsf.js\\\"],\\\"FloatingActions\\\"]\\n9:I[81888,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2stsi6mfnjcsf.js\\\"],\\\"CookieConsent\\\"]\\nb:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2stsi6mfnjcsf.js\\\"],\\\"OutletBoundary\\\"]\\ne:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2stsi6mfnjcsf.js\\\"],\\\"ViewportBoundary\\\"]\\n10:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2stsi6mfnjcsf.js\\\"],\\\"MetadataBoundary\\\"]\\n12:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2stsi6mfnjcsf.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/35uu22j