AE.</p><h2>Transparent &amp; Glass LED — FAQs</h2><h3>How does transparent LED work?</h3><p>LED strips are mounted on a see-through lattice or film, so content displays while 60–90% of light passes through — keeping glass facades and windows visually open.</p><h3>Where is transparent LED used best?</h3><p>Glass facades, car showrooms, mall storefronts and atriums — anywhere you want digital content by night without losing daylight or visibility by day.</p><h3>Can transparent LED be retrofitted to existing glass?</h3><p>Yes — adhesive LED film retrofits directly onto existing glazing, while lattice panels mount just behind the glass with minimal structural work.</p>\"}}]\n15:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"seo-content-block\",\"data-testid\":\"seo-content-block\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"eyebrow\",\"children\":\"Specification guidance\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"children\":[\"Solutions — Transparent\",\" — project planning\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"seo-content-block__copy\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"Solutions — Transparent. Premium LED display solutions by Brightluxx in Dubai, UAE.\",\" Brightluxx helps teams translate viewing distance, ambient light, operating hours and site constraints into an LED display specification that can be installed, maintained and expanded with confidence.\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Start with the audience and environment, then confirm pixel pitch, brightness, processing, power access and serviceability. Our engineering team can review drawings, recommend a suitable display family and coordinate the practical requirements for delivery and commissioning.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"className\":\"seo-content-block__links\",\"aria-label\":\"Related Brightluxx resources\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L7\",\"/products\",{\"href\":\"/products\",\"data-testid\":\"seo-internal-link-products\",\"children\":[\"Explore LED displays\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"→\